      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey can u help me write a quick email to our resin supplier? our invoice for this month says we got 500 units of the polymer resin but our warehouse receipt only shows 420. i need to ask them for a credit memo for the 80 units we didnt get and also just ask them to explain why there was such a big difference. make it professional but firm so they dont ignore us. thx",
