      "content": "Subject: Inquiry and Request for Credit Memo for Discrepancy in Resin Order\n\nDear [Supplier's Name],\n\nI hope this message finds you well. I am writing to address a discrepancy I noticed in our recent order and to request a credit memo for the missing units. As per our invoice for this month, we received 500 units of polymer resin, yet our warehouse receipt only shows 420 units. This leaves us with a shortfall of 80 units.\n\nI understand that errors can happen, but I would appreciate it if you could provide an explanation for this discrepancy at your earliest convenience. Additionally, I kindly request a credit memo for the 80 units we did not receive.\n\nThank you for your prompt attention to this matter. I look forward to your response and a swift resolution.\n\nBest regards,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Position]\n[Your Company Name]",
