      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Subject: Urgent: Discrepancy in Resin Order and Request for Credit Memo\n\nDear [Supplier's Name],\n\nI trust this message finds you in good health. I am writing to formally address a discrepancy in our recent order and to request a credit memo for the missing units. According to our invoice for this month, we received 500 units of polymer resin. However, our warehouse receipt only indicates 420 units, resulting in a shortfall of 80 units.\n\nI understand that errors can occur, but it is imperative that we resolve this matter promptly to ensure our quarterly audits remain unaffected. Therefore, I kindly request that you provide an explanation for this discrepancy at your earliest convenience. Additionally, I would appreciate a credit memo for the 80 units we did not receive.\n\nIf such discrepancies continue to occur, we may need to review our supplier agreement to ensure our business interests are adequately protected. I trust that you will treat this matter with the utmost urgency and professionalism.\n\nThank you for your prompt attention to this matter. I look forward to your swift response and resolution.\n\nYours sincerely,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Position]\n[Your Company Name]",
